## Remediation Steps

1. Disable account `john.smith` immediately
2. Force password reset on compromise confirmed
3. Block IP `10.10.242.248` at firewall/EDR level
4. Review `/home/john.smith/.ssh/authorized_keys` for backdoor keys
5. Check for cron jobs or new user accounts created post-compromise
6. Enable fail2ban or equivalent to auto-block after N failed SSH attempts
7. Enforce MFA on SSH — use public key authentication, disable password auth

